{"sym":"KARO","name":"Karooooo Ltd.","crypto":false,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"Singapore","employees":7395,"website":"https://www.karooooo.com","exchange":"NasdaqCM","summary":"Karooooo Ltd. provides software applications for fleet management, mobile asset tracking, workforce management, and video solutions in South Africa, the rest of Africa, Europe, the Asia-Pacific, the Middle East, and the United States. It operates through Cartrack, Carzuka, and Karooooo Logistics segments. The company offers Cartrack, a mobility SaaS cloud that provides systems integration, fleet management and administration, field worker management, video-based safety, risk mitigation and compliance, delivery management, and reporting solutions; and Karooooo Logistics, a software application for management of last-mile delivery and general operational logistics. It also provides physical and e-commerce vehicle buying and selling marketplace. The company serves consumers and sole proprietors, small and medium-sized businesses, and large enterprises. Karooooo Ltd. was founded in 2001 and is headquartered in Singapore.","ko":{"overview":"카루는 차량 관리, 이동 자산 추적, 현장 인력 관리, 영상 기반 안전 솔루션을 제공하는 SaaS 회사입니다. 남아프리카공화국을 중심으로 아프리카, 유럽, 아시아태평양, 중동, 미국에서 사업합니다.","segments":["카트랙 (차량 관리 SaaS)","카루 로지스틱스 (라스트마일 배송 관리)","카주카 (중고차 거래)"]},"price":64.07,"prev":63.65,"mc":1979333760,"next":{"date":"2027-01-19","timing":"amc","ts":"2027-01-19T20:00Z","estimated":true,"eps_avg":9.9868,"eps_lo":9.66,"eps_hi":10.52,"rev_avg":1685406240,"rev_lo":1666353000,"rev_hi":1713705420},"fin":{"rev":6062368768,"rev_g":0.22,"eps_g":0.177,"gm":0.6734,"om":0.2575,"pm":0.176,"roe":0.3516,"fcf":1078731648},"val":{"pe":30.95,"fpe":22.62,"peg":null,"ps":0.33,"pb":10.55,"ev_ebitda":1.2,"eps":2.07,"div":2.34},"health":{"cash":648512000,"debt":1426089984,"de":45.8,"cr":0.64,"short":0.022,"short_days":3.0,"inst":0.1793,"insider":0.6761,"beta":0.89,"avg_vol":82753},"analyst":{"mean":74.0,"lo":69.13,"h